    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Make a Google Sheet with a tab named **Support log** and paste the header row from `sheet-headers.csv`.\n2. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and your email.\n3. Connect Gmail (trigger and any Gmail node), Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n4. The trigger checks unread mail matching `in:inbox -from:me` every minute. Change that search in **New email** to match your inbox.\n5. Send yourself a test from another address, check the result, then switch to **Active**. Nothing is ever sent to customers: replies are saved as drafts.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "629aea51-3ee0-5b86-8264-048aec953c78",
      "name": "Note: setup",
